T* (were experiences of my own, the rest those of boys who were schoolmates) Tj
T* (of mine. Huck Finn is drawn from life; Tom Sawyer also, but not from an) Tj
T* (individual?he is a combination of the characteristics of three boys whom) Tj
T* (I knew, and therefore belongs to the composite order of architecture.) Tj
